WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.325
Unit ten. Playing Outside!

2
00:00:04.279 --> 00:00:07.945
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.995 --> 00:00:11.455
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.505 --> 00:00:15.158
Today we learn about Playing Outside. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.009 --> 00:00:19.459
Play. Say it with me. Play!

6
00:00:22.963 --> 00:00:26.130
Run. Say it with me. Run!

7
00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:32.745
Jump. Say it with me. Jump!

8
00:00:36.254 --> 00:00:39.420
Ball. Say it with me. Ball!

9
00:00:42.907 --> 00:00:46.357
Friends. Say it with me. Friends!

10
00:00:49.888 --> 00:00:53.921
Outside. Say it with me. Outside!

11
00:00:57.417 --> 00:01:01.184
Fresh air. Say it with me. Fresh air!

12
00:01:04.662 --> 00:01:07.762
Fun. Say it with me. Fun!

13
00:01:11.264 --> 00:01:19.004
I like to play outside with my friends. We run, jump, and kick a ball in the fresh air. Playing makes my body strong and my heart happy.

14
00:01:19.054 --> 00:01:20.204
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:26.913
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:26.963 --> 00:01:28.113
Jump!

17
00:01:28.828 --> 00:01:34.059
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.109 --> 00:01:35.261
Fresh air!

19
00:01:36.525 --> 00:01:42.437
Did you know? Playing outside in daylight helps your body get ready for a good night's sleep!

20
00:01:42.487 --> 00:01:44.412
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.279 --> 00:01:53.192
Think and answer. What is your favorite game to play outside?

22
00:01:53.242 --> 00:01:54.392
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.486 --> 00:02:00.167
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.217 --> 00:02:02.777
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

